		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=16068#p16068"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,<br />quelqu&#039;un peut m&#039;aider a reduire ma requete ci dessous?</p><p>INSERT INTO stk_organisation_staff_in_charge (stk_organisation_id, staff_in_charge_individual_id) SELECT (SELECT max(stk_organisation_id) FROM stk_organisation), (SELECT individual_id FROM ind_individual WHERE complete_name = TRIM(&#039;TEST&#039;)<br /> and split_individual_staff =1) WHERE TRIM(&#039;TEST&#039;) != &#039;&#039; AND (SELECT individual_id FROM ind_individual WHERE complete_name = TRIM(&#039;TEST&#039;) and split_individual_staff =1) != NULL;</p><p>surtout&#160; je souhaite eviter d&#039;ecrire 2 fois la requete<br />SELECT individual_id FROM ind_individual WHERE complete_name = TRIM(&#039;TEST&#039;) and split_individual_staff =1</p><p>Merci</p>]]></content>
